flowchart TB
  U[Visitor · Customer · Merchant · Courier · Admin]
  subgraph CLIENT[Responsive Web Application]
    WEB[React 19 + Vite 8<br/>Role-aware routing · ID/EN · Light/Dark]
    RTCLIENT[Socket.IO Client]
  end
  subgraph SERVER[Application Server]
    API[Node.js + Express 5<br/>REST API and authorization middleware]
    RTSERVER[Socket.IO Server<br/>Realtime chat transport]
    SERVICES[Business Services<br/>Auth · Store · Product · Commerce · Finance<br/>Delivery · Review · Chat · Notification]
    REPO[Final Repository<br/>Canonical reads and writes]
  end
  ORM[Prisma ORM 6]
  DB[(MySQL 8.4<br/>Final 20-table E-Commerce database)]
  PAYMENT[Midtrans API / Snap<br/>Configuration-dependent]
  MAP[OpenRouteService + OpenStreetMap<br/>Delivery distance and map display]

  U --> WEB
  WEB -->|HTTPS / JSON| API
  RTCLIENT <-->|WebSocket / polling| RTSERVER
  WEB --- RTCLIENT
  API --> SERVICES
  RTSERVER --> SERVICES
  SERVICES --> REPO --> ORM --> DB
  SERVICES -. configured payment requests .-> PAYMENT
  WEB -. routing / map requests .-> MAP

